        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.neworleans.com/blog/post/irish-channel-neighborhood-guide/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood’s roots lie in shotgun homes and a working‑class culture tied to local ports and breweries.",
