        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.neworleans.com/blog/post/irish-channel-neighborhood-guide/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Today Irish Channel still feels residential, yet it buzzes with a thriving brewery scene and popular local hangouts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
